    <string name="settings_audio_choice_text">Android treats music sent through myCar like sharing your screen, so it asks every drive. Over Bluetooth it never asks, if your car plays the phone\'s music that way. You can change this later in Settings.</string>
    <string name="settings_audio_choice_command">Or keep it and stop the question for good: plug the phone into a computer with USB debugging on, and run this once.</string>
